	NPC-056: Lost, are you?
label Questions
- Is this the way to the town centre? [if {TGO.quest("QIQ-008").is_completed()} == false]
	Devin: Where can I find the town centre? Is this the way?
	NPC-056: Aye. Follow the road. Can’t miss it — even with that torch of yours.
	Devin: What fault has my torch?
	NPC-056: A torch made from a gin-soaked rag? A waste of good liquor. But I suppose you’ve got stronger priorities than taste.
	Devin: What business is it of yours?
	NPC-056: Talk gets around fast when a masked stranger shows up.
	Devin: As gossip is wont to do.
	jump Questions
- I should be going.
	Devin: Good day.
	NPC-056: Keep your nose clean, hunter. You should watch yourself.
	[end_timeline]
